      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This soo much!\nMy current avatar count is growing every month and showing an avatar off I made 2 years ago requires a few minutes of scrolling through my avatar list.\nI would love to have the ability to sort avatars in a folder-like structure so i can group all \"different outfits\" of 1 model into one group, have experimental test avatars hidden away and all meme/topical avatar in another location for quick access.\nOne thing that could be a nice start is to have the ability to mark an avatar as hidden in your avatar list.  (similar to public/private)\nHidden status would remove an avatar from the default list and would only allow to be loaded by going into an expanded list or by use of pedestals/cloning (if public).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
