      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How about the ability to add tags to our avatars? Generic ones for example, Good, Medium, Poor, Gogo, Audio Link, Marker, Particles, would be great to filter the uploaded section by.\n\nEven better would be to create our own tags e.g. bunny, cat, haptic, dancer, fidget, cyber.....\n\nHaving the function added to the control panel in unity, but also the website and in game would be great.",
